Why can you die of starvation when you have full hit points?  I was of the 
opinion that hp reflected body condition, and the reason you starve to death is
because your body condition deteriorates. Similarly, I don't see why you should
EVER starve to death while wearing a ring of regeneration.  You should stay in
the "Hungry" mode, but never further than that.  You may argue that you run
out of energy to move, but it takes lots of energy to regenerate, and that's
what the ring gives you.
  Of course, if the ring is working on your starvation, it won't be able
to heal battle wounds very well, now will it?  :-)
